{"type":"text","timestamp":1782045290082,"sessionID":"ses_115d53c1dffetxIIVSFSNdvJVT","part":{"id":"prt_eea2d1f60001k5IYqyMlcglxyy","messageID":"msg_eea2d11a0001yD0nqpM6fBFzQ9","sessionID":"ses_115d53c1dffetxIIVSFSNdvJVT","type":"text","text":"Done. Books REST API implemented in TypeScript with Express + better-sqlite3 + Zod.\n\n**Files created:**\n- `package.json`, `tsconfig.json`, `vitest.config.ts`, `.gitignore`\n- `src/db.ts` — SQLite connection + schema\n- `src/validation.ts` — Zod schemas (title/author required)\n- `src/books.ts` — `/books` CRUD router (POST/GET list with `?author=`/GET/PUT/DELETE)\n- `src/server.ts` — Express app factory + `/health` + entrypoint\n- `tests/books.test.ts` — 6 integration tests (health, full CRUD, validation, author filter, 404s)\n- `README.md` — setup/run/endpoint docs\n\n**Verification:**\n- `npm run build` — clean compile\n- `npm test` — 6/6 passed\n\nEndpoints return appropriate status codes (200/201/204/400/404/500); data persists to SQLite (in-memory by default, file via `DB_PATH`).","time":{"start":1782045286240,"end":1782045290080}}}
